WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.480
Evaluate the versioned
application as a system.

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:07.280
Run baseline and candidate configurations
against representative cases,

00:00:07.312 --> 00:00:10.080
with independent scoring
and agreed release floors.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.800
Retain outputs and tool actions together.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:15.560
A failed case returns to diagnosis.

00:00:15.653 --> 00:00:18.800
An accepted candidate proceeds
through controlled deployment,

00:00:18.865 --> 00:00:21.720
monitoring and reviewed case curation.

00:00:21.893 --> 00:00:26.640
Re-evaluate relevant changes
in prompts, retrieval, memory, tools

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:31.600
and authority rather than treating the
model name as the entire release identity.
